# Copy to .leak-terms (gitignored) and put YOUR terms in it: one per line,
# searched as literals, case-insensitively, over the files git tracks.
#
# What belongs here: the names of private projects and ventures, client names,
# internal hostnames, account handles you do not publish under, the paths of
# private directories, and any phrase from a document that must not leave the
# machine. What does not: words that are generic to your trade, because a scan
# that always fails is a scan nobody reads.
acme-internal-project
client-name-here
~/private/
